  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/712667498197155862/966307899309715476/drill_logo_copie.png?width=1440&amp;height=504\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"393\" /><br /></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;-</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjXvVIzBkFmmGjOBAq-zGIg/channels\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/891582128310063164/952947600833777724/youtube.png\" width=\"165\" height=\"90\" /></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/k3fGJwJqzu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/891582128310063164/952947601219665960/discord.png\" width=\"165\" height=\"90\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/unsusualsquad/\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/891582128310063164/953302370723463228/reddit.png\" width=\"164\" height=\"89\" /></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;-</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"> <strong>Unusual Drill 新增了高效挖掘大範圍（3x3）的工具（鑽頭、鋸子、鏟子）。每種工具都有三種獨特的材料等級，根據工具不同，使用海磷石、地獄磚等材料！</strong></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">（需安裝&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>&nbsp;以查看所有合成配方）&nbsp;</span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>合成中使用的基本工具：</strong></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/712667498197155862/966307681755344946/emboutl_render.png\" /></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>鑽頭</strong></span>，<strong>等級1：</strong>鐵，<strong>等級2：</strong>海洋之心，<strong>等級3：</strong>獄髓</span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/712667498197155862/966307681495306240/drill_render.png\" /></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">鋸子</span>，等級1：</strong>金，<strong>等級2：</strong>地獄磚，<strong>等級3：</strong>鑽石</span><br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/712667498197155862/966307682040545281/saw_render.png\" /></p>\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">鏟子</span>，等級1：</strong>竹子，<strong>等級2：</strong>烈焰棒，<strong>等級3：</strong>終界棒</span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/712667498197155862/966307682317385778/spade_render.png\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>萬用鑽頭</strong> </span>：<strong>等級1</strong>：地獄幽靈之淚，<strong>等級2：</strong>不死圖騰，<strong>等級3：</strong>地獄之星<br /></span></p>\n<p><strong>萬用鑽頭可以挖掘所有類型的方塊！</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/922393407802986496/973235819211005982/multidrill_render.png\" /></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>你可以將 Unusual Drill 放入你的模組包中！<br /></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
